        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Animals: Arctic fox\n- Places: Arctic, Himalayas\n- Concepts: Seasonal coat color, ancestry, Swedish names\n\nFacts:\n- The Arctic fox is white in winter and brown in summer.\n- The Arctic fox lives throughout the Arctic.\n- The Arctic fox can trace its roots to an extinct animal that lived in the Himalayas.\n- The Swedish name for the Arctic fox is Fjällräven.",
